      <h1 class="page-title post-title reveal">Nigeria Harmonises Virtual Asset Regulation: The Presidential Executive Order on Virtual Assets Coordination, 2026</h1>
      <p class="page-lede reveal">The Order establishes a coordination framework across the CBN, SEC, NRS and other regulators, rather than creating a new regulator.</p>
      <p class="post-meta reveal"><time datetime="2026-08-16">16 August 2026</time></p>
    </div>
  </section>

